Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:08.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Once there was a man who obtained everything, the legendary Pirate King Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,His last words before he was executed inspired people to sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.61,Main,,0,0,0,,All my wealth and treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,It can be yours if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:17.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Search for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I left everything in that one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.66,Main,,0,0,0,,People now set sail in search of romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The world has entered a Great Age of Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:29.29,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:33.79,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.79,0:00:37.46,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:43.04,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise our flag to the Break of Romance Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:43.04,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(366,460)}Translation & initial timing\N{\fs40}Yibis Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:49.70,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let the waves crash, they'll jump start us out of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.21,0:00:48.81,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,438)}Timing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Time-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:54.23,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,If we're going to go to an incredible world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.17,0:00:54.23,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(277,493)}Quality-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil\NGalaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:00:58.75,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,you'll have to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:58.75,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(510,470)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.70,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Standing out too much, is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.59,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Wanted â†’ Means a Winner ( â€¢ v â€¢ )
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:10.47,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Freedom is our only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:15.96,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Forget our worries, just let the wind blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:18.49,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be the first to find One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:18.49,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1047,408)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:22.45,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our hearts dream beyond measure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:26.90,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,so let's never wake them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:29.38,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:33.51,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,Dawn can't come soon enough, I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:37.30,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:44.69,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We... made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:47.59,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go... wherever our dreams take us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:52.67,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,and we won't leave anyone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.27,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We'll go at it with all our hearts, that's a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:59.27,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,On that day when our dreams began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:03.69,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,we set our goals and they've never changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:06.21,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,I can't stay still! I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:10.58,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,The sun in my heart will never set!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:13.35,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:17.52,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.79,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,One, two, Sunshine, four... We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:30.00,We Go lyrics,,0,0,0,,We Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:34.41,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait!  Luffy-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:36.61,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Hey!  Wait, Megalo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:38.57,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:43.04,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,Father, brothers, and everyone in the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.35,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:46.98,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,I'm going out without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:53.54,Thoughts,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,I'll be back in time for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,Let's go for a walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.22,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Megalo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.50,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,You left the door to Koukaku Tower wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.06,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,What if something happens to the princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:12.54,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Pirate!  Hurry and see to the princess's safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:15.48,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,You're working my bones too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:25.12,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,She's gone!  Princess Shirahoshi is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:28.84,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,What?!  The Mermaid Princess is not here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.54,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,This is awful!  A national crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:34.46,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,When did this happen?  Who could have done this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.63,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,She's been kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:37.90,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Kidnapped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:41.05,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,{\i1}Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.28,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Oh, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.97,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,She's been kidnapped, has she{\fscx250}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:48.72,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Hey!  What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:56.85,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,The channel that connects\NRyuuguu Palace and Fishman Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:03:59.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Where is the switch to open it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:01.24,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,What?  Switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:04.32,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Either way, we must hurry back to Neptune-sama, Skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:07.91,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,We need to report this to him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,We've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:16.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Following their orders is our only chance of survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.80,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Tell us already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:21.52,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Who are "they"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:24.55,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,If you don't, they'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.55,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Kill you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.52,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:42.98,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Listen up, pirates working for Hody Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:50.33,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,You're in luck!\NYou get to be a part of this historic event!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:54.81,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Vander Decken...\NIsn't he the captain of the Flying Dutchman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:57.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,The captain of the cursed ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.53,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm just his descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.36,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I'm not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.25,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,But I, too, have been cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.28,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I'm a fishman, yet I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:14.89,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Let me show you the power of the devil\Nthat I gained with the Mato Mato curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:21.25,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Alright, you'll do.  Human, come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:25.86,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.37,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Are you really going to do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.99,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Stop this madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:39.08,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,It's him!  Hachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.04,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,It's Hachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.17,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,It's Hacchan-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:43.54,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Hachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:48.13,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,The Energy Steroid is just a drug that destroys your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:51.09,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Why are fishmen trying to destroy Fishman Island?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:53.89,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate\Nthe champion of the sea, Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:57.93,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Hachi-san, give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:06:00.93,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I have no interest in your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:04.90,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe that\Nyou were once a member of the crew I looked up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.51,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,You've become weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.20,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Your time has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:19.36,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I need Fishman Island if I want to teach\Nthe humans a lesson, and Neptune is in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:23.75,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,You guys were the ones who taught us\Nthat we are the superior species.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:26.62,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,But Arlong-san lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.92,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Decken!  Hyouzou!  Why are you siding with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:38.25,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,You refused Arlong-san's invitation back then,\Nso why are you helping these young fools now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:44.22,Main,Hyouzou,0,0,0,,Helping?  I'm just working here because he pays me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:50.79,Main,Hyouzou,0,0,0,,Arlong didn't want to part with his cash\Nso he couldn't employ me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:56.29,Main,Hyouzou,0,0,0,,Too bad Arlong could only obtain a swordsman of your caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:01.15,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,So you're Hachi from Arlong's crew, huh?\NNow that sure takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:06.71,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Your captain once tried to recruit me as his underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:08.83,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,But I couldn't agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:12.78,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I could never let someone boss me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.89,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Hody here understands that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:20.68,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Arlong-san's ambition and his\Nability to act on it were admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:31.23,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,However, he was all brawn and no brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:38.44,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Even if we wanted to, we were too young to become pirates while you were out raising a ruckus at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:41.74,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,And now everyone who grew up in those days\Nhas assembled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:45.87,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,So our resolve is strong, and we've learned from our predecessors' mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:51.20,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I am the man who will carry on Arlong's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:56.72,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,And you, a former member of the crew I admired, are saying that you have a problem with my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:08:00.35,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,That's really discouraging, Hachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:06.79,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,And while we're on the subject, Straw Hat Luffy is here.  The very man who shattered your ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:09.61,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Don't you even care about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:14.77,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,He called me his friend,\Neven though I used to be a member of Arlong's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:18.41,Flashbacks,Luffy,0,0,0,,The three of you are my friends! {Copy-paste from 394.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:22.67,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,I owe Straw Hat Luffy my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:24.29,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,I would go to meet him right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:32.70,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,{\i1}but while Arlong's will lives on,\NI couldn't possibly face him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.66,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Humans are your friends?!  You piece of trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:40.22,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I'm utterly disappointed in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.93,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I'm locked on to you, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.73,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten how pirates do things?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:55.30,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,If you have a problem with someone,\Nyou'll have to resolve it with violence...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.49,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I presume!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:00.54,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,Where'd he throw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:06.03,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,When I touched you just now, you became my target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:09.29,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Whatever I throw and wherever I throw it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:12.45,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,it will change its course like a hunting bird,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:17.29,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,and head straight for its target: You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.69,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,It looked like he threw that knife in some random direction, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:22.76,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,It hit the octopus fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.27,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,The Mato Mato curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:30.88,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Of course, there {\i1}are{\i0} several ways to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.15,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Why don't we give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:36.28,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Stop!  Don't throw all those arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.65,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors about your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:42.45,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hody, he'll kill me at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:45.05,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Please, stop Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:47.47,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Didn't he just tell you, Hachi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:50.94,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Vander Decken is not my underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.95,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,We're two pirates who have made an alliance on equal terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:58.86,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Besides, you're just a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:00.30,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,You damn coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:01.64,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:06.48,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.93,0:10:13.98,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Good!  Run away, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:15.45,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,But wherever you go...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:19.36,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Wherever you go...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:22.16,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Wherever you go... they'll chase you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.13,0:10:25.95,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,If only I could make it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.29,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Alright, now I can escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:34.97,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Those arrows won't be able to follow me in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:40.63,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Damn!  So it doesn't matter\Nif they're in the water or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:42.21,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:04.61,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,The number of targets I can keep in my memory is the same as my number of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:05.49,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:10.09,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,My right hand, that I haven't washed for ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:16.41,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,stores the memory of when I touched\Nthe princess of Ryuuguu Palace.  Shirahoshi herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:20.42,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,You get it?!  All the love and weapons I throw...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:24.21,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,will pursue my target even into the depths of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:26.21,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,That is my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.17,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:32.01,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,So that's how you've been able to keep up\Nyour insidious stalker crush...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:35.52,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,without being seen or caught by the Neptune Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.97,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:38.82,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,What a cunning man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:43.86,Secondary,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8\fs40}Cunning!  Cunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.86,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Now then, human pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:47.48,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,You understand Decken's ability now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:50.87,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,So now it's time to begin phase one of our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:58.47,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,They say it's impossible to\Nbreak into Ryuuguu Palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:06.12,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,but one man has been able to\Nthrow things in there for the last ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.57,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Namely, Vander Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:18.56,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,In other words, this plan consist of {\i1}you{\i0} being the objects thrown by Decken...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:23.28,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,and flying straight toward the Mermaid Princess in Ryuuguu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:29.27,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Though, you'll actually crash into the tower's hard walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:36.08,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Then, once you're inside Ryuuguu Palace, you'll open the gates from the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:39.99,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,and let us in.  That is your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.22,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,No way!  If you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:46.07,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,We'll crash into the walls and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:47.72,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Indeed you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:52.31,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Which is why we're using the lives of you worthless humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:57.17,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Down here, you're worth less than slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:00.79,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Those who survive the crash will carry out the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.16,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,If it goes well, I will set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.99,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,If you refuse the mission, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:11.05,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,I will throw you outside the bubble right now,\Nyou inferior species!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:15.84,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,N-No way!  If you do that, we'll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:21.60,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,In that case, you just have to take your chances on the method that leaves some slight chance of survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:23.66,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:31.94,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.94,0:13:35.86,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,is the beginning of a new chapter in history for us fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:41.20,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,It starts when we conquer the Ryuuguu Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:43.02,Main,Fishmen,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.88,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,I'm coming now, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:56.53,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,And now we return to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.02,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:00.10,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,I will not wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:03.00,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Hurry, skeleton!  To the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:06.74,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Wait!  We have to open the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:10.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,Or Hody will kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:11.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:16.01,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,He ended up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.01,0:14:18.31,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,beating up all the soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.31,0:14:20.94,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,We hadn't done anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:25.64,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,Well, they wanted to put me in handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:29.24,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,Look!  Everyone is looking at us so coldly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:31.28,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,Their eyes are like the fish of the deep sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:35.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,Oh, quit whining.  It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.72,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should have thought about that\Nbefore beating them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:41.04,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,You took out half of them too!  With your Kung Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.44,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,You were pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:47.57,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,E-Even if you say that, I'm not happy at all, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,The voice of a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:54.04,Main,Persons,0,0,0,,Someone covered in blood has washed ashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.97,Main,Persons,0,0,0,,Aren't you from the Fishman District?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:57.83,Main,Persons,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.76,Main,Persons,0,0,0,,Someone, get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.50,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:05.97,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,Hachi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,What happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.78,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachi, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.15,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,How did you get all those injuries?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.15,0:15:16.49,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.33,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,It's you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.92,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,I'm glad I found you.  Is Straw Hat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:27.96,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,He's not.  Wait, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:32.84,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Gather your crew.  Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.41,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,You're better off...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:39.10,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,not getting involved in this island's affairs any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:41.22,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Leave Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:47.26,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,The New Fishman Pirates are going to\Nattack this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:51.76,Main,Hachi,0,0,0,,Ryuuguu Kingdom will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.28,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,Neptune-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:16:01.71,Main,Right Minister,0,0,0,,She's been kidnapped!\NThe princess was carried off by someone or another!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.06,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Also, a group of pirates came raining down by the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:09.58,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,Anyway, we are under attack!  Under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:15.83,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,Kidnapped?!  Who could have taken Shirahoshi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:20.23,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,An enemy attack, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.79,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:26.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why now?!\NWe're already attacking the palace ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}W-What should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:31.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}On second thought, don't answer that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:32.69,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,We'll cut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.69,0:16:34.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said don't answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.56,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,If we're going to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:42.08,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,We have to open the gate to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:43.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,H-Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:48.18,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna come out of the shark now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:51.75,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,N-No, I'd rather stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.69,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,How does it feel,\Nbeing outside for the first time in ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.47,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,My heart won't stop racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:17:00.38,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,I have done something really awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:04.21,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,Just going outside isn't bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.24,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,You're so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.51,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:18.85,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,what they call an "adventure"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:27.37,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,If you're this excited, then it's an adventure alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:30.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,You said something about the Sea Forest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,What is that?  Is it a fun place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.20,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,A grave...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:40.11,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,There's a grave there that I haven't visited once since it was built.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:44.64,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,Not once in all these ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:47.56,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,It's the one place I've wanted to go to the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.73,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,Has it really been ten years...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:18:02.28,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,since the assassination that took place in broad daylight, throwing Fishman Island into chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:05.04,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,How time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:11.05,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,The princes have grown into fine warriors...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:15.52,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,and Princess Shirahoshi is still inside that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:22.46,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,But nobody has forgotten about your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:25.60,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime.
